{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 133,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2e7023e69302ec3687ea48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "媒体主导设立的新赛事\\n<color=#FF6D26>『闪耀明星巅峰赛』</color>\\n这是为决出最强者的战斗！\\n来吧，朝着梦想启程\\n以各项最强为目标吧――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56eed1f9a50b0436646a42d8a5181d7cfa13985a3424c153f18e6ad3e78b432",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cd244f642d25ce4875a165d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出现在想要全力支持赛马娘的训练员们\\n面前的是，被冠以三女神之名的\\n助训AI。领受三女神的睿智，\\n以称霸赛马娘界的顶点赛事――\\n<color=#FF6D26>『Grand Masters』</color>为目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3a648dfe23eaa260365623fcca7fc0ad8806ef73ecea5b320fe3a06faad9d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbbb04cf382f68baef5ada45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "世界最高峰的比赛『凯旋门赏』。不断有挑战者\\n力图赢取胜利。「今年誓要成为世界第一！」\\n特雷森学园设立了<color=#FF6D26>『L'Arc计划』</color>。\\n追寻梦想与浪漫的旅途，现已拉开帷幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77c456267b352a3f2290866f2efe770c2e7e5022f0ebdff09d844847c05a0da0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eca0ca8c0b49c1d99268d0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决出No.1运动员赛马娘的\\n综合体育大会<color=#FF6D26>『U.A.F.』</color>开幕！\\n赛马娘们将在15种独特的比赛中\\n挑战自我极限，挥洒汗水！\\n运动员们的灵魂共鸣，请拭目以待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8944b725bda56fdd898f043b86ee2d156a5ddaaca94ae2691a4a63cb35f8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163b8adade8cd58712a0c6cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着秋川理事长宣布开放农田，\\n特雷森学园的大农耕时代开始了。\\n烈日之下，大家一起挥动锄头；\\n日落时分，众人共同围坐餐桌。\\n来吧，今天我们也去种田吧――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4245a5126f8c425e43eaf92edffb045cada30eadc262e4be7f8c909cc6124faf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7ad93c7255a7ea392ca365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中出现了机械赛马娘。\\n那是由天才博士砂糖光制作的机器人。\\n不过它还是初始型号，仍有许多问题……\\n让我们去强化它，来实现博士的梦想吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03568a8ece876de23aa2714308de226c4289f3902cf6aa19bee1a7101bca37a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "120",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c1b789322496bc59bf649",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b7403a88a4e418b46366498f75a6027548a8d37f7703bc4c4059ad48f82b6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9befb9684f2aedcdef89403c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "传奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be03a92c934c61c9b2cd7acbcf10356ecf821a3e8800c75b346a1992032485c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ddf0ae86c43c2d10371a47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "未冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f10fffc71d29135c2b2db5b65abf5bd4265b8ae6cd063a4deb19d9de4b925b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8508fa88a820fbcb9a426a57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "初学者",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e88fbb082e96cb53db4cd24a66336ef19d597eb145318562d53834bbc57286e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a569acda53927d7f81847636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "青铜",
      "source_fingerprint": "4608039c93643b11e4266732b39b159b391002925f344fba36be2f9da20728f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8adf6625e0c5082c8d53d67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "白银",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab15443bb5a257cf372b26679826f74950a88b3e220d0b3ff084c62146a1e2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ce459a190680773531fdbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "黄金",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb72f61f1175160de5b0114fb8e113341ef9377d751a734fe26ef38c110aa6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1414bccd83ab78919c5ea5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "白金",
      "source_fingerprint": "a883d3ec17ef58ad17c929315e80172264c24e91d12bafeb520855ddc3d2884e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c2dd17bb480889ce692dea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "明星",
      "source_fingerprint": "61852f503151452e10f88d431c52e8da6fb3f923d965e0248bfb8e92aba270ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c55fccd2066fa52a33f9a5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顶级明星",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b25fefa5b3951ce6f191d3eac246b66b74e729b1383dee550b5747edc8cf55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "121",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869cd06e8c2a8d13896aa9c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉饰URA总决赛的欢快歌曲。\\n马儿跳♪马儿跳♪绝对能带起现场的气氛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca0a69d88943c4f2a6ba935358fa033fbc59b57bc8a9939007c9d0b8a4324070",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32534c621c0e3f52cad487cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们两人一起，什么都可以做到！\\n这充满活力的乐曲，一定也能令你欢笑☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5050c0e710a6e76414cc064f905caf37e22d828f76b02998ff171e3cc8cf1396",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8413b24294453735b45a0a76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为和你一同奔跑ー\\n我们的旋律永远不会停止。已经，不会再回头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d39ea31f558d5cad69cd63639f26896c1b6d8b49ae76eb25598569c49380920",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd91d3bf294c19ef09f8edc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "仅赠予荣获三后冠的女王们的歌曲。\\n华丽的同时，也有着顽强追梦的美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80a55b72c2a740cff1f9760c28c28e5735e42fdf5cd90aca6aa814166601e7ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f812a8a4770d3d3afe8e2dbb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "献给刚出道赛马娘的首支歌曲。\\n吹响那开场号！响彻至终点吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "253236cd6601347b62670db8bec41a60e6d01f6b0b49164e7693f8613b894889",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082c951d547d52abdfc82222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在新马级比赛中表现出色的希望之星们展现的清爽乐曲。\\n赛马娘们疾驰着，她们的梦想闪耀着七色的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f371580e198265e7db1e610301664c7f66a398b93354c0abeae3e04be3b5ced0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c43ce2538bc2cf1f1d7249d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有以顶点为目标，不懈努力之人才能抵达。\\nNEXT FRONTIER――这是为永盛不衰的霸者设立的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c2abad9b89360bb5d985eccb540592ecacaeb3fe094c633eec082e38077c1cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ceaec0846bade035eb9c52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赠予即使在泥泞之中也以不屈斗志战斗下去的赛马娘的灵魂之歌。\\n即使被疾风骤雨夺去视线，脚步也不会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c402d5af3d6f7331266206ea14505e686c73614b64d80aeaeee15e2db9de73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524437de3ce445f93754f76b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "照亮GⅠ胜利这一特别的瞬间，在天空绽放的歌曲。\\n只要一直追寻想要实现的未来的话，梦想就一定会实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3facaa36bbf7bb1d711f925fe82b210472b6cc0121ca03aac4be7969dfb01ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43443b41e5b8f9645c1ec7ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论奔跑还是玩耍，我们都全力以赴！　用旋律来承载\\n大家缤纷的梦想――Let's Go Starting Gate!",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee200ed6fca9f666e15df40ab35ff8f946f45fa1834e9d1be666b1d9f98ce25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af1dcfb7fbeb84d4e7b2a54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "星光照亮前路，你的未来充满光明。\\n为支持我的人们表达感谢的1曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7641ddc99e7ffeb05e026364d9bba1df777bf3d5166ab0d398a9850fb17c6ade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc6c1ef4029f090a2ee316c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "キラキラ！トキメキ！ただ輝く景色を駆け抜ければいい！\\nだって、僕らは愛されるために生まれてきたのだからっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73103edd8673496b46e80d574eca927d92a6e86ad5235e4e8327975002ace8f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a08773c1635145f9c653503",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "经常吵架，也互不道歉――但是，想永远一起欢笑下去。\\n这是青涩而又略带苦涩的，我们的友情应援歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d3797827b94fee2e8976b0de37eceade8a45baf959b6798ccec16e26701f01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4356f25f4741607a818a6b75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把过去、现在所经历过的全部装进宝箱，面向未来！\\n――来吧，让整个世界充满『最喜欢了！』吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e02d74559e808073ffeb2a8ef6329c1fc7177c59ec1755ab2bb469d0800f140",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34bcf34bd6b40461dd198bea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "疾驰的一等星闪耀着，充满勇气与希望的歌曲。\\n心动的预感――那就是比赛开始的信号",
      "source_fingerprint": "316e2a7163d6866624623d20eb585422f060c2a13763ce6ddae613c616b180a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b617fbe398dac5891c75ec7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若我启程奔跑的话——这是一首融入了虚幻而坚强意志的歌曲。\\n将的思念藏在心中，向夜空中高悬的明月祈祷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e905da63e6e793b2e43a4f06587a18e8bc2209eba77821546a19d68debad554",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1498bbabc0338106c4409b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心中所起誓的是『最快』二字！　直到极限的尽头\\n疾驰的赛马娘们遵循本能地呼喊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d11166ef0fea76dec387749bf2fd196b5992cef50c8c12d3f8e75670795f01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317744a81c16e2f2bc618e52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有赢得经典三冠者才有资格演唱的歌曲。\\n这首歌曲是所有赛马娘的『向往』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "586fb412869663ed682723ec58b0a1ebc22a47971c6efa5095a89d0d0de18b76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe1b6fe8e6d5a57c7f8e100",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要与你一决胜负。少女们心怀绝不退让的信念，登上舞台。\\n无论是灯火或是烟花……无论怎样的光芒，都绝不可能比身为“主人公”的她们更为闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "451e1bf65f2a4495d2cedac5a3e005536f03281342ef3df4a281853565d4b362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89010f4405f60f723dba30f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有认真的你陪在身边，我才不论何时都能朝着胜利冲刺！\\n充满活力的青春之歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "903059c11428286414447e28b27c7b6750c61944fd255502e9019b86b5fab5c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b89551a25dd48b4a2ff954",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对比赛的渴望、执着、焦燥……能感受到炽热而沉重的灵魂的歌曲。\\n即使依旧被命运所囚禁，也无法停止追寻希望的脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4384c7ab92038ef64b37e3277341dd9f2c6002d19938260af892da0e53b5438",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9743508c73999cd1196c3ae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与劲敌一同演唱的爽畅歌曲。\\n『我将与你一同追寻梦想』――这是个铭刻于心的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55e4f89854dc11ac05cd4c9f79e2d6ba262a2c70ca3651dbd0f9b704e2ceab0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507f1caa3e66bf528e406006",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首乐曲中寄托着大家对未来的憧憬，即便是满天繁星也不及\\n这份心意那般耀眼。你也应是观众之一——梦幻灯光秀，开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed00fb0f71fe1f9c231f165a2983f1e5fc26c0beeb5ff0a741735909f7d5d637",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9680c95dbe96a9a386e62b7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有欢笑也有泪水！将赛马娘们的悠闲时光\\n咻♪的一下塞进去的学园生活之歌☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a697247f2a4d9865c8c630c406626610657a1ec91cf10f70d6c43d10e02e52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5540d834b3601b910967023a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『因为已不是独自一人，所以才会变得更强』\\n大家一起哭泣、欢笑、奔跑――这是牵绊与青春的旋律。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0488fa70f0a556bacb822c2376f4fc56ee9d96b55d384e93b4973a6f15b55865",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c89f0e476ce770ed31a53f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越春夏秋冬，只为与你共奏一曲合音。\\n胸中激昂的心跳化作旋律——终于，遇见大家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8b6418ea46c154ae2556d6d2190b112faeeac88ebbf3c72abb1f4ff3e4601a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da41ce34e2a1d18aee6b11db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着未知的终点，未曾见过的景色――\\n神秘而又温暖的旋律，推动着你，轻语道：『奔跑起来吧』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98a180c0907dc3357b0dae3151c6ab1a57d7ec74d42f55f1e6cbfc1290ef7b42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a3767321b11ae9cbca3b40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "友情、竞争、眼泪、笑容、不安、希望――\\n全部都是闪闪发光着的歌♪『青春』一定就是这样的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50b55d8423cf9573edd350559d6daf12e1ca9752f11b1663599c9645aeb130f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001d948bfb04b0b9edc11858",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "描绘了互相切磋的少女们的心意的乐曲。\\n梦想多么高远、多么宽广、多么蔚蓝生辉。来，一同前行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbec9999bc68a0bb15899e52500f78e4bc5afbc0af44e45f19295a434dad578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded1aefad3969e2e268d2d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要向着梦想奔跑。这是谱写了这份决心的乐曲。\\n即使迷茫，即使不安，也要向前迈进。将这首歌作为路标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04b62a9696999297efd11a8b212e6b94a11d055275f7ed1d107baf6a6eed360a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8faaa9e82a3f63fbb7166a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "紧靠着被冷雨冻僵的肩膀，誓要创造奇迹的少女们的歌曲。\\n我会无数次闪耀，只要有梦相伴——只要有你相伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca95c7db1a5a9052dd000d45521132ec6f1b7db05b5809e994360abce87ca76a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe4b4180bed948266ec76a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是，顶尖马娘偶像！拿起麦克风，以愉快的心情\\n用可爱又活泼♪的笑容来唱歌吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "613b8afc06885196bcec06d0e016de691faae00251bb6030b6e6a0addcb219c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f1e5632ce1ca42741a94b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『一逃到底☆SISTERS』将，冲入你的心灵！\\n毕竟，恋爱最重要的就是冲刺！对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "784d31dfde51518c790ff48c16274f6328fbf11533ce1e945f0debe1e6cb7946",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26260496dfac85637d6f50e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻轻回响于心灵的摇篮曲。\\n越是痛苦与疲惫时，越要『PAYAPAYA』。……有什么意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdaf19287081f2cf8ff0e6511e7d3bbcc92fcfeb69806c6a5623a4662dbf33f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7af6650002ea407eaa6f7a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闸门已经敞开。对奔跑者而言一切都是广泛而平等的。\\n――来吧，挑战吧！来吧，奔跑吧！向着那强风吹拂的方向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f76179a79e89d9aac291948c744a3efce397d8671916414db440a020f343cbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838b700b0e50a12fa745bfd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "属于爆进！根据爆进！！为了爆进而作的歌曲！！！\\n听了这个的你，也是爆进伙伴了！（谈：班长）",
      "source_fingerprint": "63db370251f70bfc16dd743a4c1ffb3c7c8d8395b1ac27e52a9807d384cc4768",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f475c793e7ff99d300a8ba5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一周年纪念之际，满怀感激之情所创作的歌曲。\\n我们会朝着梦想之后的梦想、甚至是再往后的梦想不断奔跑——与你同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1d72c15ad4c8e4924d116da720938e56997bc4c7c043d146a8ba4d2564ffaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee32e23a310b8ee70df2f7b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不断奔驰——直到梦想实现的那一天！\\n将赛马娘们由笑容与泪水所编织的青春融入其中的歌曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba44ee848c39937fc62e35683a77448c682c0eaee4bb3da63f601b080e3f7958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f566fbbaf7c905c7cfa7c77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无",
      "source_fingerprint": "484d55613910eb8c0917fe308b499d474115ced993cd002a17d7cc75254330a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cf2f3278db8a0000569f39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "霓虹灯下舞动，委身于节拍。一首让夏天更加火热的乐曲！\\nLive也好比赛也好，绝不能把观众的视线让给任何人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e4f68370565412e5892193350f7c7b29bfbc37f64104a323c2a4d8de29c2957",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c556c705608cc092fe6f59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌颂激情、热血、一马当先的胜者之歌。\\n铭刻于历史的胜利之时，将永远留下其熊熊燃烧的余韵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7684189df04e5f4d851f7689e47723383523e04066379ec3f9a55510c4cbb94f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1185193ee53cb7750cb44a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看那儿！是船！？还是UFO！？都不是，是小金船哒！！！\\nPeace Peace♪怎样～？这块地方被我掳走咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c844b0ff87dd26a2d607a806bae3f6975f6bb1430729d07b31a86dae994b1382",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e206b23f6d7353c39ca57a84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "由名门目白家演唱的，旋律庄严的合唱曲。\\n目白家族的荣光，无论何时都至高无上，绵延不绝――",
      "source_fingerprint": "483979e51f5217c2c9551ac0248eafb98a211317b64f2cc81580a0fcbabdf28e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea682e017009b260a37994e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首伴着汗水与泪水的闪耀歌曲！闪闪发亮的可爱马娘偶像\\n背后是踏踏实实的努力☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b7fb5cc8212384928de2569e1f5fbc369ad6a2a58b72a063af10873ef89e0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95773ed3f946b9fb3b654d70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首歌颂自遥远的过去延续至今的灿烂光辉的歌曲。\\n那绵延不绝的光辉，还将继续奔向未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b731c1b2292aa3b69eeae59b762774eeaaeb4eca1413075ab7afec8a4371bf9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e6ffdcb42505d1070149c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在闪电战般的赛场上展开激烈竞争的同伴们，与她们所演唱的歌曲。\\n无论何时都想要保持微笑――\\n因此才要拼尽全力，奔向胜利的彼岸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "050a9d2b20ad70c365bc636fad4eed4a3b313aaef94f486257b1715bf0efb60f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25304bb9c6d48340815342b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首献给肩负辉煌未来的诸位英雄的歌曲。\\n目标是名为梦想的财宝，向着未知的大海――启航吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f1d646027fad2dbcd3f8e7ed47a98e273cf95630ae34bf56fade12c943e191a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a04059ea36edd214d1cc99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有争斗、也有和睦！摇曳地♪塞满了赛马娘们软乎乎～时光\\n的学园欢歌♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a522d7026238744cf1ab2dd9e179cf66bcf0eb40f826a269e2dd39df6b098d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a590e60b4da1ad36ab63a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸣奏出因期待而跃动的心，相当令人跃跃欲试的歌曲♪\\n将这特别的梦，传达至大本命◎的你身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "288e210bfc4a8c47003fa31948819c16903342c1b68c247f05c08fec310da6d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba6cecbef73bd7af8dad5c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝不背叛那日的约定与决心。\\n这灰色的觉悟，将成为最闪耀的希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb59853842fefc019d41ee86c3d7c8ed562dd6b775c6f4b3c91ac32607d825b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0327588b26cadc305a30b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将胜利握入手中。疾驰至天涯海角。\\n无人可挡，那觉悟便是――『一马当先，万马无光』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f6b20f4c60ae2c2dfa464eb93288b1a24f7ff349bd0d341dd22031461a6e0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edc585d5fe60b7db9c7e06ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "温柔地向支持者们表达感谢的，治愈的旋律。\\n我想用硕大的爱去回应。与你一同，踏起柔和的步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b4ae24abdabae1ed216e6ddd029cea9234660753045f8cdbaebc12891630a6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e4f467bdb420ebcabcb5130",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "势必劈开所有迎面而来的狂风。轰鸣着白色斗志的1曲。\\n胜利不可退让，故继续抗争。那就是，咱的战斗之道呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3bf4c3df6ba37a480934770c192e9f7b329d66f00b51dac42a5640166e89b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e85776dbf767bec4076f297",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以向往之心纺织而成的，纯情之歌。憧憬永不会停止。\\n因为……唯有这场比赛，我不愿败北。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b1823c88499c79c354f7056d09af963ce26fcd466f13c0f196428be047afef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d9e84b2202b9fa15c55fb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱响那憧憬之梦、那背负心愿而奔跑的决意的歌曲。\\n做一个永不会结束的梦吧――不论几次、不论何时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcccf66ae8e67f5f45eb3f0141147d5aaf9263a289cf97032ff77ed752be89f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e3256fe07ae725eae30ea0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起未来、比起过去，更要把握燃烧生命的现在――\\n心怀对那刹那光辉的祈祷，玻璃的叙事曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "438c5ac49d388c5e37f9cb0751b6193ec819f7a105a775faa815e1a24dee18bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7774f4156404476efabc3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻柔地、婀娜地……如微风般奔跑的自由之歌。\\n旋律时而改变风向，随心吹拂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0bc38637afe7e810a7e0106c69d731bbf4db8e9c43c0f7efd8c3672ad7a62f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce190c5feb2295b51a8967a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "带着那无法抑制的心跳声飞翔起来吧♪\\n直奔那憧憬之地！的雀跃之歌！Take Off☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd07586b6f177e6c1d3228f4f567307aee8ca068e444db0ca272fae2224a4a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad63d077655cbf5ef71298b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无法忘却的心愿、无法放弃的梦想，为了保持住曾经的自己……！\\n直到那不屈樱花绽放之日，这歌声不会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c20f2f64abadcceb02fb93dd4c10a555eb521ec6d4438ebee80dd676421e1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6c03bcb0321952be2f9e1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "VayVa～y！嗨起来嗨起来↑像开趴一样有趣的乐曲☆\\n总之先保持微笑？咱毕竟是太阳嘛！所以间奏就拜托咯～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c77afe689cbeb4ebfc204904aa5274e171521cdccb02f205d4bc4e3d2853a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421b11e1dffbd75a43972983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的轻盈，又有几分边缘感的乐曲。\\n那些日子的苦痛，请你一定不要忘记……好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "027f58c3c3f929365e50c5a4a6d6ed01dcee2ec7b7e44169f628850e0c95889a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3244435c442fdca562090fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "阿船's RAP！DE情绪燃起来！\\n阿船与RAP，搞一首试试吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6283b47fce6fdef7a8620e9bcfc27a1581a6128d9bcac46c2941bd7ced65fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73d94bb5b1e3464bc85cfc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一等星所编织的故事，延续至最闪耀的光辉。\\n那份心愿被继承――将再次成为梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2610056ce1ea7e526a9783601c44669da603b2c1e97130f4707262d7b9722fa6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
